Although all six reconstructed claims reached `#Top`, unconstrained proof-only symbols allow false conclusions such as `"a.pdf" → "Yes"` and `"a.txt" → "No"`. The fresh non-vacuity mutation failed correctly, but that does not repair the unsound operational bridges.

